This project copies grokhouse's isometric engine, art, kinds, actors,
viewer, HUD, sounds, and styles. Sign-in, token, GrokBotService, and
Cloudflare Worker parts of grokhouse were not used. Status and chat
in this project come from /api/status, /api/chat, and /api/reply.

Copied or adapted files include:

  src/engine/*
  src/scene/*
  src/ui/hud.ts
  src/layout.ts
  src/state.ts
  src/sound.ts
  src/styles.css
  src/types.ts
  src/protocol.ts (types only, from grokhouse's worker/protocol.ts)
  public/kinds.json
  public/paper.svg
  public/favicon.svg
  public/sounds/*

Sound effects are CC0, from Freesound via Openverse.
See public/sounds/CREDITS.md.

